NHS. Shoulder pain; Leicestershire Partnership NHS Trust, shoulder guidance. English.

[Authorized source](https://www.nhs.uk/symptoms/shoulder-pain/).

Read when to seek help and the broad distinction between common complaints and urgent presentations. [The NHS trust guidance](https://www.leicspart.nhs.uk/msk-physiotherapy-resources-getting-started/upper-limb/shoulder/) also discusses chest and breathing symptoms. UK service numbers and referral arrangements apply to the UK. [SAMU 192](https://www.gov.br/saude/pt-br/composicao/saes/samu-192) is the Brazilian emergency-service reference used in the guides.

